      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1332090239,
      "version": 634,
      "versionNonce": 506023953,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803045659,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "An employee passes the following user\nquery to the research agent: \"Research\nremote work productivity tools that\nengineering teams are adopting and see\nif any correlate with our internal\nproductivity metrics\"",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "right",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "An employee passes the following user query to the research agent: \"Research remote work productivity tools that engineering teams are adopting and see if any correlate with our internal productivity metrics\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "TKYTvHDj9pqF3ouF_KlVF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -724.8932107588953,
      "y": 9078.210163293836,
      "width": 348.30712890625,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1780813215,
      "version": 630,
      "versionNonce": 803222911,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803123719,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Skills in action: This research agent\nleverages specialized skills, including:\n• Research methodology skills that guide\nsystematic literature review\napproaches\n• Data correlation skills that provide\nframeworks for identifying meaningful\npatterns\n• Business intelligence skills that ensure\ninsights align with organizational\npriorities",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Skills in action: This research agent leverages specialized skills, including:\n• Research methodology skills that guide systematic literature review\napproaches\n• Data correlation skills that provide frameworks for identifying meaningful\npatterns\n• Business intelligence skills that ensure insights align with organizational\npriorities",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "L7MmTT6pPz44nc9yh8CTz",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -715.8340812558563,
      "y": 9501.404607738279,
      "width": 478.3848876953125,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 512754111,
      "version": 515,
      "versionNonce": 1703355889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803152497,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Based on the thinking analysis, Claude plans its approach:\n• External web search for productivity tool adoption trends\n• Internal database queries for company productivity metrics\n• Parallel tool execution for optimal efficiency\n• Correlation methodology for synthesis",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Based on the thinking analysis, Claude plans its approach:\n• External web search for productivity tool adoption trends\n• Internal database queries for company productivity metrics\n• Parallel tool execution for optimal efficiency\n• Correlation methodology for synthesis",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8OvGqdhkk_wBk53zTGZN6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 311.9417893864811,
      "y": 8768.973153791287,
      "width": 605.4412231445312,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1304916447,
      "version": 515,
      "versionNonce": 1985686943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803166896,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Claude leverages its native parallel tool calling capability to execute multiple\ntools simultaneously:\n• Web search tool (via MCP: Searches for remote work productivity tools and\nadoption data\n• SQL database tool (via MCP): Queries internal productivity metrics across\nteams and time periods",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Claude leverages its native parallel tool calling capability to execute multiple\ntools simultaneously:\n• Web search tool (via MCP: Searches for remote work productivity tools and\nadoption data\n• SQL database tool (via MCP): Queries internal productivity metrics across\nteams and time periods",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "j9rqMvYq_ENZNHoBruv1O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 216.62668667303296,
      "y": 9045.401725219861,
      "width": 766.0714285714274,
      "height": 160,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1625021951,
      "version": 759,
      "versionNonce": 309280721,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803178943,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Think: \"Web search returned comprehensive tool categories and general adoption trends, but need\nmore specific data on engineering team preferences. Database query successful—have baseline\nproductivity metrics. Need refined search for quantitative adoption data and team-specific\nfeedback.\" Claude executes follow-up queries based on this analysis:\n\n• Web search tool: Refined search targeting engineering-specific adoption patterns\n• SQL database tool: Targeted queries correlating tool implementation periods with productivity\nchanges",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Think: \"Web search returned comprehensive tool categories and general adoption trends, but need more specific data on engineering team preferences. Database query successful—have baseline productivity metrics. Need refined search for quantitative adoption data and team-specific feedback.\" Claude executes follow-up queries based on this analysis:\n\n• Web search tool: Refined search targeting engineering-specific adoption patterns\n• SQL database tool: Targeted queries correlating tool implementation periods with productivity changes",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ZQbiJrC28ArrTjMTHSneB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 217.7013569255032,
      "y": 9284.866010934144,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 80,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1254999583,
      "version": 546,
      "versionNonce": 2130846143,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803270082,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Think: \"External research shows clear adoption trends across development tools, project management\nplatforms, and communication systems. Internal metrics reveal productivity variations across teams\nand quarters. Crossreferencing implementation timelines with performance data to identify\npotential correlations while accounting for external factors.\"",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Think: \"External research shows clear adoption trends across development tools, project management platforms, and communication systems. Internal metrics reveal productivity variations across teams and quarters. Crossreferencing implementation timelines with performance data to identify\npotential correlations while accounting for external factors.\"",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "i-KYe7ix28PAGwen86aPR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -79.06357385950832,
      "y": 9442.721853265857,
      "width": 615.3931884765625,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 2,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "NaGlm3Q6Vbnu-0CYYI0E4"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1250798143,
      "version": 571,
      "versionNonce": 49880497,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "created": 1791803288689,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Result generation: Claude synthesizes findings using extended context\ncapabilities to maintain full conversation context and provides consolidated\nresults:\n“Research identified several categories of remote work productivity tools with\nsignificant engineering team adoption: development environment tools…”",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Result generation: Claude synthesizes findings using extended context\ncapabilities to maintain full conversation context and provides consolidated\nresults:\n“Research identified several categories of remote work productivity tools with\nsignificant engineering team adoption: development environment tools…”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "oN4lwM8V3lQkDGE_K_C_w",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2545.5144311144795,
      "y": 5504.931407496897,
      "width": 363.3121337890625,
      "height": 41.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "yDrAjkJz8Zp9jGTMqY0Pn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1828457055,
      "version": 633,
      "versionNonce": 452301279,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Model Context Protocol",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Model Context Protocol",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "created": 1791803405329,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "pN33cW66yzvIiad6gUhn-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -2868.903469200417,
      "y": 5586.598074163565,
      "width": 1026.778076171875,
      "height": 1050,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "Uf46MSUliqx-87x1BSbAC",
        "DeEu3DmkwJI40fdz40vE6",
        "SNSHQSWUKGsRkw8t3l_I4",
        "-Yp3XHFDf6FeZEO3shiSR",
        "Jp3d5nLfo-BfZwxUkrTXM",
        "8IpsMeS5980-iw8mMeeDW",
        "yDrAjkJz8Zp9jGTMqY0Pn"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b7n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1323918975,
      "version": 9198,
      "versionNonce": 1716273041,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792409321299,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open-source standard for connecting AI applications to external\nsystems.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLet's say you're building a chat interface where users can ask Claude about their GitHub data. A user\nmight ask \"What open pull requests are there across all my repositories?\" To handle this, Claude needs\ntools to access GitHub's API.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGitHub has massive functionality - repositories, pull requests, issues, projects, and tons more. Without\nMCP, you'd need to create an incredible number of tool schemas and functions to handle all of GitHub's\nfeatures.\nThis means writing, testing, and maintaining all that integration code yourself.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MCP (Model Context Protocol) is an open-source standard for connecting AI applications to external systems.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nLet's say you're building a chat interface where users can ask Claude about their GitHub data. A user might ask \"What open pull requests are there across all my repositories?\" To handle this, Claude needs tools to access GitHub's API.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nGitHub has massive functionality - repositories, pull requests, issues, projects, and tons more. Without MCP, you'd need to create an incredible number of tool schemas and functions to handle all of GitHub's features.\nThis means writing, testing, and maintaining all that integration code yourself.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "created": 1791803405329,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
